owly navigate an unforgiving darkness. Remain alert everywhere you go, because you'll never know when something might strike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214900/extras/87b9440aa37b8e85898505f89653a3cf.poster.avif?t=1761836836\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214900/extras/87b9440aa37b8e85898505f89653a3cf.webm?t=1761836836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214900/extras/87b9440aa37b8e85898505f89653a3cf.mp4?t=1761836836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story shaped by your actions. Escape, get caught, or fight back - all actions have consequences. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense, oppressive, and immersive atmosphere. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied monster encounters. One is silent, another lures you into false safety, and one will always know where you are. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized elements ensure no two experiences are exactly alike. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various puzzles and riddles as you uncover the nightmare's secrets. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility Note</strong>: What Hides in Dreams features a &quot;Dyslexic Mode&quot; which changes the game's text to a font intended to assist those with dyslexia.</p>", "short_description": "To the now sleeping self...welcome back. Face the horrors only a sleeping mind can conju